{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"全曲以「喜欢露出来」和「对方是否愿意继续亲近」两条线交织推进。呼应词统一使用日常说法：「喜欢／在乎／藏着／露出来」指心意的变化；「开口／那句话／没说完的话／说出口」指反复出现的表达冲动；「对方没退开／仍愿亲近」指关系中真实发生的回应；「陪伴／需要自己」指依恋逐渐从猜测变成愿望。S01从忽然想靠近开始，怕自己的需要成为对方的负担，只敢露出一点喜欢。S02以「对方没退开」第一次得到安心，却仍怕靠得太急弄坏自在，也开始舍不得眼前的好。S03那句想说的话刚冒头便淡去；S04回望「上回没开口」，这次几乎想把心意说尽，却又怕对方为难、怕失去原有的自在。S05几次收住之后，终于不知不觉忘了藏，喜欢也被对方看见。S06再次确认「对方看见了却没有退开」，但对方不知道他刚才有多怕被嫌弃，于是安心之后又有孤单，并开始猜对方是否也舍不得这份亲近。S07从对方一直愿意相伴，渐渐相信自己也许是被需要的，进而盼望往后仍能被对方想起。S08把这种盼望变成主动回应，甚至开始想象两人能好很久；S09却把不安具体化为「有一天对方不再需要自己」，随后又借眼前仍然存在的亲近，找回一点高兴。S10暂时停止猜测以后，只愿好好享受当下。S11发生重要变化：他不再以对方是否需要自己为前提，仍愿意陪伴，也不再为喜欢藏着；但对方未来是否愿意接受这份陪伴，并不是他能决定的。S12让欢喜彻底涌出，不再强迫自己收住，也不再把对等回应放在喜欢之前。S13重新想要一句不会改变的保证，害怕失去而想把喜欢藏回去，却发现自己已经无法像最初那样装作不在乎，收回反而更难受。S14回望那个连多露一点喜欢都紧张的自己，仍有舍不得和不确定，却不再逼自己索要永远的保证，最终选择不再藏着，让以后真正到来时再面对。呼应只在确有回望和因果联系时点染，不把「开口／不藏」变成每段重复的口号；S07的被需要之喜、S12的尽情喜欢、S13的想退又退不回、S14的温柔放下，都保留各自独特的情绪重心。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"忽然想靠近对方连自己都意外\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"怕成负担只露一点喜欢已觉甜\",\n          \"detail\": \"他还拿不准，下次能不能更坦白些\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"见对方没因他在意而退开才敢放松\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"喜欢快藏不住又怕太急弄坏自在\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"越觉得此刻亲近美好越怕它转眼过去\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"难得不想以后只想安心待在亲近里\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"想说喜欢也想问对方是否一样却没能开口\",\n          \"detail\": \"念头刚冒出来，话还没想好就淡了\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"熟悉亲近又让他欢喜也想起上回没开口\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"想把藏着的话说尽也盼对方喜欢他的坦白\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"想说出口留住眼前好又怕对方为难而收住\",\n          \"detail\": \"他也怕说得太多，连原本自在都弄丢\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"对方没退开他便忘了藏喜欢被看见\",\n          \"detail\": \"前几次话到嘴边，他都还是收住了\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"怕对方嫌他太黏连原本亲近也隔了一层\",\n          \"detail\": \"藏着时还能装作没那么在乎，如今却不能了\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"对方看出他在乎仍一如从前他才自在\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"对方不知他刚才多怕被嫌他忽然孤单\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"对方没退开他便猜对方也舍不得这份亲近\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"想起对方总愿相伴也许也需要自己\",\n          \"detail\": \"也许和他待在一起，对方也能安心些\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"想到自己也被需要他高兴得舍不得抽身\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"盼对方往后需要陪伴时仍想到自己在身边\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"见对方仍亲近他便想大方回应也盼长久\",\n          \"detail\": \"上回无意露出心意，这回他不再处处分析\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"想到今天的好未必天天都有他又没底\",\n          \"detail\": \"快乐余温还在，心里却已泛起怀念\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"怕对方哪天不再需要自己连相处也不愿意\",\n          \"detail\": \"刚才还敢盼很远，这会儿却不敢往下想\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"对方仍愿亲近也许也喜欢自己陪伴\",\n          \"detail\": \"不安还没得到回答，却暂时不再占满心思\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"怕再猜下去毁了今天他先享受眼前亲近\",\n          \"detail\": \"这只是一小段喘息，不是永远的避风处\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"紧绷慢慢松开他亮得想笑又想哭\",\n          \"detail\": \"心事并没解决，只是这一刻不必再强撑\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"即使对方未必需要他他仍愿陪着不再藏喜欢\",\n          \"detail\": \"想到自己这么在乎，也没什么可害臊\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"他仍愿陪在身边，想到对方未必愿意便心疼\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"只想把能给的都给对方暂且不问是否被在乎\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"明知再用心也保不住以后仍想多陪一会儿\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"欢喜终于整个涌出他不再逼自己收着喜欢\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"想听一句以后不变却明白没人能答应永远\",\n          \"detail\": \"先前的幸福是真的，正因相信过才怕失去\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"怕对方有天不再需要自己想藏回喜欢却更难受\",\n          \"detail\": \"最初怕给对方负担，如今怕连亲近也失去\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"idx\": 0,\n          \"point\": \"回望起初不敢多露喜欢的自己心里又软又酸\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 1,\n          \"point\": \"他仍舍不得也不知以后如何却不再逼自己求永远\",\n          \"detail\": \"眼下还能这样亲近，已经值得他珍惜\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"idx\": 2,\n          \"point\": \"既然喜欢已被对方看见他便不再藏着往后再说\",\n          \"detail\": \"\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "728a9861-4830-4315-b71b-c70dee696ee0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T191722966384Z", "elapsed_seconds": 434.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:24:37.642935+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "520c97f839273e79d29bbd4a9a87ce1d2125026a3c16ae29821513e86b337669", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initiali